Use the actual uploaded file content.

## 6.3 Frontend-only processing libraries

Use suitable browser-side libraries, including:

- `pdfjs-dist` for PDF parsing and page rendering.
- `tesseract.js` for OCR of scanned PDFs and images.
- Browser Canvas APIs for image extraction and cropping.
- `ExcelJS` or another suitable library for actual image-enabled XLSX generation.
