## 6.10 IMAGE PRESERVATION — NON-NEGOTIABLE

The original question document may contain images.

Images can appear:
- Inside question text.
- Between question text and options.
- Inside Option A.
- Inside Option B.
- Inside Option C.
- Inside Option D.
