- Discard images.
- Stretch images.
- Use local temporary file paths.
- Put all images in one unrelated worksheet.
- Associate images with the wrong questions.
- Generate placeholder images.

### Image extraction

Use PDF page geometry, text coordinates, question numbering, module boundaries and option boundaries.

Extract actual raster images or render and crop the relevant PDF image regions where necessary.

Preserve:
- Original content.
- Aspect ratio.
- Useful resolution.
- Correct question association.
- Correct option association.
- Multiple-image ordering.

