- Zoom images.
- Reassign an image to Question Text.
- Reassign an image to Option A/B/C/D.
- Remove an incorrect association.
- Reorder images.
- Review uncertain associations.

If an image association is ambiguous, mark it for review and prevent successful export until it is resolved or explicitly handled through an approved workflow.

Do not silently associate images based on guesswork.

